@startuml Kafka SocketServer 极简架构

title Kafka SocketServer 极简架构图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

' 三层架构
package "网络层" {
  component SocketServer
}

package "通道层" {
  component RequestChannel
}

package "业务层" {
  component KafkaApis
}

' 外部
actor Client

' 连接关系
Client <--> SocketServer : 网络 I/O
SocketServer <--> RequestChannel : 请求/响应
RequestChannel <--> KafkaApis : 业务处理

' 简要说明
note right of SocketServer
  - Acceptor: 接受连接
  - Processor: 处理 I/O
end note

note right of RequestChannel
  - Request Queue: 请求队列
  - Response Routing: 响应路由
end note

note right of KafkaApis
  - Handler Pool: 处理线程池
  - Business Logic: 业务逻辑
end note

@enduml
